        rdfs:comment "SHA-3 with a digest length of 384, as defined in [FIPS 202](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/202/final)."@en .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/sha3_512> a owl:NamedIndividual,
            ns3:HashAlgorithm ;
